{"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Related Documentation","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/GettingStarted","doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockServiceReference"],"anchor":"Related-Documentation"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/HowToImplementService"],"generated":true,"title":"How-to Guides","anchor":"How-to-Guides"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/howtopreviewandtest"]}],"abstract":[{"text":"Drive ","type":"text"},{"code":"AnalyticsService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" from SwiftUI previews and Swift Testing suites without touching Mixpanel’s network.","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/HowToPreviewAndTest","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics"]]},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" calls into a real ","type":"text"},{"code":"MixpanelInstance","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". For previews and tests, swap it for ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockMixpanelAnalyticsService"},{"text":" — an actor that records every call and exposes its history for assertions. The mock has no Mixpanel dependency and runs offline.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"In a SwiftUI preview","type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"In-a-SwiftUI-preview"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Inject a mock-backed store and the analytics work flows without spinning up the SDK:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["#Preview {","    let store = AppStore.configured(analyticsService: MockMixpanelAnalyticsService())","    return ContentView().environment(store)","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"This requires that ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AppStore.configured"},{"text":" accepts an injected ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnalyticsService"},{"text":". See Swidux’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"https:\/\/heirloomlogic.github.io\/Swidux\/documentation\/swidux\/howtoaddanalytics","isActive":true},{"text":" guide for the factory pattern.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"In a Swift Testing suite","anchor":"In-a-Swift-Testing-suite","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use the mock to verify mapper behavior. Await the plugin’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"flush()"},{"text":" to make assertions deterministic:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","import Testing","","@Test","func incrementMapsToCounterAdded() async {","    let mock = MockMixpanelAnalyticsService()","    let store = AppStore.configured(analyticsService: mock)","","    store.send(.counter(.increment(5)))","    await store.analyticsPlugin.flush()","","    let events = await mock.trackedEvents","    #expect(events.first?.name == \"counter_added\")","    #expect(events.first?.properties[\"amount\"] == .int(5))","}"]},{"type":"heading","text":"Asserting on identify and alias","anchor":"Asserting-on-identify-and-alias","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The mock records identify and alias calls in order:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["@Test","func userSignInIdentifies() async {","    let mock = MockMixpanelAnalyticsService()","    let store = AppStore.configured(analyticsService: mock)","","    store.send(.auth(.signIn(userID: \"user-1\")))","    await store.analyticsPlugin.flush()","","    let calls = await mock.identifyCalls","    #expect(calls == [.init(userID: \"user-1\", properties: [\"tier\": .string(\"free\")])])","}"]},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MockMixpanelAnalyticsService"},{"text":" is an actor, so its accessors are async — wrap them in ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"await"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"sections":[],"kind":"article","metadata":{"title":"How to Preview and Test","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics"}],"role":"article"},"references":{"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/GettingStarted":{"role":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the package, build "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService"},{"type":"text","text":" with your token, register the analytics plugin, and start dispatching events."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/GettingStarted","title":"Getting Started with SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/gettingstarted"},"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/HowToImplementService":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/HowToImplementService","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/howtoimplementservice","title":"How to Implement the Service","type":"topic","role":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Configure ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService"},{"text":" to match your privacy, residency, and batching needs — without ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import Mixpanel"},{"text":" in your app.","type":"text"}],"kind":"article"},"https://heirloomlogic.github.io/Swidux/documentation/swidux/howtoaddanalytics":{"identifier":"https:\/\/heirloomlogic.github.io\/Swidux\/documentation\/swidux\/howtoaddanalytics","titleInlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add Analytics"}],"url":"https:\/\/heirloomlogic.github.io\/Swidux\/documentation\/swidux\/howtoaddanalytics","title":"Add Analytics","type":"link"},"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/MockMixpanelAnalyticsService":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"MockMixpanelAnalyticsService","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockMixpanelAnalyticsService","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/mockmixpanelanalyticsservice","title":"MockMixpanelAnalyticsService","fragments":[{"text":"actor","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MockMixpanelAnalyticsService","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Recording "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnalyticsService"},{"text":" for previews and Swift Testing suites.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/MockServiceReference":{"role":"article","abstract":[{"text":"API reference for ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockMixpanelAnalyticsService"},{"text":" — a recording ","type":"text"},{"code":"AnalyticsService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" for SwiftUI previews and Swift Testing suites."}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockServiceReference","title":"Mock Service Reference","kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/mockservicereference"},"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics","title":"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","type":"topic","role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Mixpanel adapter for Swidux’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnalyticsPlugin"},{"type":"text","text":". Owns the Mixpanel SDK on the app’s behalf — "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService(token:)"},{"type":"text","text":" calls "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mixpanel.initialize"},{"type":"text","text":" internally so apps never need to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import Mixpanel"},{"type":"text","text":". Ships a recording mock for previews and tests."}],"kind":"symbol"}}}